[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16861.31, "timestamp": "04:41:01", "text": "最后期限临近。于是我开始工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16865.708, "timestamp": "04:41:05", "text": "更多的是，但我也感觉很痛苦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16875.948, "timestamp": "04:41:15", "text": "而且，很可能接下来……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16879.35, "timestamp": "04:41:19", "text": "很可能是下个月或下个月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16882.43, "timestamp": "04:41:22", "text": "下个月，最有可能是在八月份。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16885.75, "timestamp": "04:41:25", "text": "我相信我将被迫进入获取"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16887.23, "timestamp": "04:41:27", "text": "进入大学"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16890.47, "timestamp": "04:41:30", "text": "一切痛苦。是的，我需要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16893.11, "timestamp": "04:41:33", "text": "学位什么的都对，不然我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16894.788, "timestamp": "04:41:34", "text": "付费"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16897.708, "timestamp": "04:41:37", "text": "呃，因为我浪费了两年时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16901.11, "timestamp": "04:41:41", "text": "已经这样了，我不想这样，我不想这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16902.31, "timestamp": "04:41:42", "text": "到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16906.23, "timestamp": "04:41:46", "text": "是啊，我不想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16908.67, "timestamp": "04:41:48", "text": "是啊，又浪费了几年时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16913.83, "timestamp": "04:41:53", "text": "再次。哦，等等。我可以把它扔掉吗？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16916.948, "timestamp": "04:41:56", "text": "不会再有像这样的直播了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16919.19, "timestamp": "04:41:59", "text": "我以前很喜欢自己每天都很活跃的状态。"}]